---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_published --> q_check_supplied: results published
    q_check_published --> q_revert: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_fees: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert: revert AlreadySupplied
    q_calc_fees --> q_calc_total: calculate token fees from totalTokensAllocated
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = totalTokensAllocated + tokenFees
    q_transfer --> q_mark_supplied: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_mark_supplied --> [*]: tokensSupplied = true, emit TokensSupplied
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: token fees = totalTokensAllocated * legionFeeOnTokensSoldBps / 10000
        INV-002: project must supply totalTokensAllocated plus all token fees
        INV-003: tokens can only be supplied once
    end note
